# Optional Docker DB drop-zone.
#
# This directory exists so the Dockerfile can COPY a *directory* (which always
# succeeds) instead of an optional `verdict_experiment.db*` glob (which fails
# the build when the gitignored DB is absent in a clean clone).
#
# To bake the validation database into the image, copy it here before building:
#   cp verdict_experiment.db docker-db/
# Otherwise the build initializes an empty, schema-valid DB automatically.
#
# *.db files are gitignored, so any DB you drop here stays local and is never
# committed.
